040E39             2020*   ; Restore the working pointers to their bases, then commit in reverse order.
040E39 ED 32 F4    2021*       lea ix,ix-12
040E3C ED 33 FC    2022*       lea iy,iy-4
040E3F E1          2023*       pop hl
