041899             2953*   ; Rotate one object intrinsically by a local XYZ delta. Identity table phases
041899             2954*   ; leave both state and dirty flags untouched.
041899             2955*   ;
041899             2956*   ; inputs:
041899             2957*   ;   ix -> object state
041899             2958*   ;   iy -> local Pingo-angle vec3
041899             2959*   ; outputs:
041899             2960*   ;   canonicalized orientation/Euler cache and rotation dirty bit
041899             2961*   ;   carry set leaves the complete orientation/Euler/dirty subset unchanged
